<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AGOURON LOWERED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AGOURON LOWERED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said on Friday it lowered its  rating on the shares of Agouron Pharmaceuticals Inc to buy from strong  buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The company reported a fourth quarter profit of $0.17 per share,  before charges, compared to a loss of $0.17 per share in the prior  year's quarter. It also announced a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 5/8 to 96-3/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
